  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Hypersexualization",
  "description": "The meme's focus on a vulgar, bodily assault ('kick in the nuts') targets the Obamas' bodies, particularly Michelle Obama's, in a degrading manner. This implicitly relies on the racist stereotype that Black women are hypersexualized, reducing them to objects of sexualized violence. The meme uses this stereotype to insult Michelle Obama by focusing on her body as a target for degradation, reinforcing racial and gender-based prejudice.",
